   </object></child>
   <child><object class="GtkLabel"><property name="label">Apply to all queued recordings, or the recording selected above when the queue is empty. These controls use the optional CPU audio processor. Use a tempo above 0 and up to 10; a tempo of 2 doubles the tempo and halves the duration. Uses the normalization option above. Select the audio codec tools folder for compressed input or resampling to 44100 Hz.</property><property name="xalign">0</property><property name="wrap">true</property></object></child>
   <child><object class="GtkSeparator"/></child>
